<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications rose 1.6 percent in the week ended March 21, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages fell 4.7 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages increased 3.7 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index fell 4.7 percent to 396.7 from 416.2 the previous week.</p>
<p>The purchase index rose 4.3 percent to 197.2 in the latest survey from 189.0 in the previous week.</p>
